  by: user:dmaretskyi
  supersedes: D-2
  affects: [ResearchArticle, ResultCard, ResultArticle]
```

```mdl
decision D-6: Picks and starred results are copied into the Research's feed as immutable Findings, as commerce keeps Results in Search.feed; starring uses a TagIndex, as commerce's STARRED_TAG does. The connection is a plugin-connector integration with a credential form (server URL, API token), whose URL defaults to http://127.0.0.1:4319.
  date: 2026-10-28
  by: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [Research, Finding, F-1.1, F-3.2]
