```mdl
decision D-7: The client speaks lighthouse-api /v1 only, isolated in LighthouseClient; the session stream is read over fetch so it can send the bearer token and Last-Event-ID. Fills in [D-4].
  date: 2026-10-28
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [LighthouseClient]
  why: EventSource cannot send an Authorization header; the daemon's TCP listener requires the token.
  rejected: An adapter for the web server's /api routes (no CORS, no token, no entity route; /v1 shipped first).
```

```mdl
decision D-8: The result companion's subject is a sentinel and the selected result is the Research's attention selection (its IRI), read live from the session the article streams. Fills in [D-5].
